flowchart TD
  A[Edit code] --> B[Run backend tests and frontend build]
  B --> C{Checks pass?}
  C -- No --> D[Fix locally]
  D --> B
  C -- Yes --> E[Review diff; exclude secrets]
  E --> F[git commit and push main]
  F --> G[Configured hosting integration detects push]
  G --> H[Vercel: install, build Vite bundle, publish static output]
  G --> I[Render: build/package Spring Boot app]
  I --> J[Load runtime configuration and start app]
  J --> K[Connect to Aiven; Flyway migrations if enabled]
  K --> L[Check logs and public API]
  H --> M[Verify live site and monitor]
  L --> M
